   "Entries processed in (kind, id) order; member_ids sorted",
   "Provenance.registry_entry_sha256 is sha256 of the canonical registry entry, not of the output (avoids circular digest)"
  ],
  "statement": "generate(registry) is a pure function of registry bytes and generator_version; two invocations must be byte-identical."
 },
